WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.760
Seven worlds round a small red star.

00:03.460 --> 00:09.259
TRAPPIST-1 is a cool red star forty light-years away, a little bigger than Jupiter.

00:09.709 --> 00:16.771
Seven planets about the size of the Earth go round it, and all seven were found as they crossed in front of it.
